T*
(1. WHAT PROBLEM DOES THIS PROJECT SOLVE?) Tj
T*
(It solves safe content management for a website by separating draft editing from live ) Tj
T*
(content and adding preview, publish, and revision history.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. WHAT ARE THE MAJOR PARTS OF THE SYSTEM?) Tj
T*
(The major parts are the admin authoring app, the shared content contract layer, and the ) Tj
T*
(public SSR website.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. WHY SPLIT ADMIN AND PUBLIC?) Tj
T*
(Because editing workflows and public rendering have different concerns and should not share ) Tj
T*
(the same runtime responsibilities too tightly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. WHY IS THE SHARED LAYER NECESSARY?) Tj
T*
(It gives one canonical interpretation of blocks and layouts so preview and public rendering ) Tj
